{"at":"2026-10-13T12:34:52.676Z","tool":"save_changes","args":"{\"issue\":10506,\"content\":\"Scope: latest Chrome, Firefox and Safari on desktop, and Safari on iOS. Exact font sizes are read in the \\\"F\\\" field of the \\\"Properties\\\" panel (Alt+/, \\\"Shape properties\\\" section). Use Cmd instead of Ctrl on macOS.\\n\\n# Text properties\\n\\n## C-002 Font size: switching be","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:34:55.773Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Font size gets two presets after \\\"Very large\\\": \\\"Huge\\\" = 56 and \\\"Giant\\\" = 96 (tooltips \\\"Huge\\\" and \\\"Giant\\\", no shortcuts); the existing four keep their labels and sizes, and the Font size control gets no typed-size field.\",\"source\":\"PO answers 1 and 2 on iss","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:34:57.373Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"A text at a size between presets, or a selection of texts with mixed sizes, highlights no font size preset; clicking a preset sets that exact size on every selected text, and a text at exactly 56 or 96 shows \\\"Huge\\\" or \\\"Giant\\\" highlighted however it got that size","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:34:58.774Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"Ctrl+Shift+> and Ctrl+Shift+< are unchanged by the new presets and have no upper limit, so text can be made larger than \\\"Giant\\\" (96).\",\"source\":\"PO answer 3 on issue 10506, relayed by the user and approved 2026-10-13\",\"issue\":10506}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:34:59.923Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"text-properties\",\"fact\":\"All six font size presets fit the properties panel on a 375 px wide mobile screen.\",\"source\":\"PO answer 7 on issue 10506, relayed by the user and approved 2026-10-13\",\"issue\":10506}","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:35:01.425Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"bound-text\",\"fact\":\"At \\\"Huge\\\" or \\\"Giant\\\", text in a shape wraps and the shape grows taller, an arrow label stays at the middle of the arrow, and a sticky note label offers both presets, keeps auto-fit and shows the picked preset highlighted.\",\"source\":\"PO answer 5 on issue 10506, relaye","outcome":"ok"}
{"at":"2026-10-13T12:35:02.712Z","tool":"propose_knowledge","args":"{\"area\":\"files-and-export\",\"fact\":\"The \\\"Huge\\\" and \\\"Giant\\\" font sizes are carried by copy and paste styles, copies and undo/redo, and are kept by a reload, a saved file, PNG and SVG export and live collaboration.\",\"source\":\"PO answer 6 on issue 10506, relayed by the user and approved 2026-10-13\",","outcome":"ok"}
